{"4100250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soultrail", "steam_appid": 4100250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/09b847cb02ac9f3e84a9921148d55ec8.webp?t=1766677880\" width=780 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soultrail is an online co-op horror game featuring randomly generated maps, interactive environments, proximity voice chat and monsters! You play as a Special Emergency Group member. Complete orders like clearing the lab of monsters, recovering valuable items or &quot;simply&quot; exploring to earn cash for your needs. Then, take the elevator down to deeper, harder levels of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/a5d7b1440bc2add5ecdfa9a52b8e295d.poster.avif?t=1766677880\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/a5d7b1440bc2add5ecdfa9a52b8e295d.webm?t=1766677880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/a5d7b1440bc2add5ecdfa9a52b8e295d.mp4?t=1766677880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/62c712080a29950785d0145375334321.webp?t=1766677880\" width=780 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group up with friends and combine different play-styles to survive the tasks. Remember, as time passes, <i>the danger only grows</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/f8371565b25c134997c6b78255acd9e5.poster.avif?t=1766677880\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/f8371565b25c134997c6b78255acd9e5.webm?t=1766677880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/f8371565b25c134997c6b78255acd9e5.mp4?t=1766677880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/db52b7a3d4525c853783be38e300903e.webp?t=1766677880\" width=780 height=62 /></span>Go in prepared. Use your earnings to buy some gear, from advanced tools to heavy weapons, or find useful items on-site while exploring the labs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/79e746d4a888a0cf2c645986981a72fe.poster.avif?t=1766677880\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/79e746d4a888a0cf2c645986981a72fe.webm?t=1766677880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/79e746d4a888a0cf2c645986981a72fe.mp4?t=1766677880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100250/extras/09b847cb02ac9f3e84a9921148d55ec8.webp?t=1766677880\" width=780 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soultrail is an online co-op horror game featur